# Klipper MCU firmware configuration (Kconfig fragment) for the
# Mellow FLY ADXL345 USB accelerometer (RP2040 + ADXL345, USB-C).
# The same settings fit a Raspberry Pi Pico used for a wired ADXL345.
#
# Equivalent "make menuconfig" choices (Mellow's documentation):
#   Micro-controller Architecture : Raspberry Pi RP2040/RP235x
#   Processor model               : rp2040
#   Bootloader offset             : No bootloader
#   Flash chip                    : W25Q080 with CLKDIV 2 (the default)
#   Communication interface       : USBSERIAL
#
# The board runs only the accelerometer (no steppers), so the stepper
# options Mellow lists do not matter. Expanded to a full .config with
# "make olddefconfig" by tools/build-firmware.sh, which writes klipper.uf2.
# Flashing is manual: see docs/input-shaper-calibration.md.
CONFIG_MACH_RPXXXX=y
CONFIG_MACH_RP2040=y
CONFIG_RPXXXX_FLASH_START_0100=y
CONFIG_RPXXXX_USB=y
